  "methodology": "A discovery-focused international watchlist of active and influential cancer researchers. Selection combines recent cancer-preprint activity, recent scholarly influence, major cancer research awards and funding, leadership of field-defining programmes, and coverage of major biological and translational specialties. Historical figures without substantial current research activity are excluded. Group assignment is deliberately mutually exclusive so the combined collection can be resolved without duplicate identities.",
